  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这怎么行！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD9600E4E48884CFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我可是顾客啊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621153EF662F987E5BA2554AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n虽然是我自私的请求，但你帮帮我吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF010010000201000000FF0C000A867D7136662F621181EA79C176848BF76C42FF0C4F464F605E2E5E2E62115427FF01001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我本来要搬运这个人的行李，\n但他不仅给我出大难题，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n甚至还要我跟他进行宝可梦对战。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211672C67658981642C8FD08FD94E2A4EBA7684884C674EFF0C000A4F464ED64E0D4EC57ED9621151FA592796BE9898FF0C00100001BE00000A751A81F38FD8898162118DDF4ED68FDB884C5B9D53EF68A65BF962183002001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我让你搬运我重要的波士可多拉，\n你说做不到就拒绝了，所以我才生气啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118BA94F60642C8FD0621191CD898176846CE258EB53EF591A62C9FF0C000A4F608BF4505A4E0D52305C3162D27EDD4E86FF0C62404EE56211624D751F6C14554AFF01001000020114018E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我怎么可能搬得动\n体重360公斤的波士可多拉啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211600E4E4853EF80FD642C5F9752A8000A4F5391CD003300360030516C65A476846CE258EB53EF591A62C9554AFF01001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "闭嘴！你明明搬不动却还做出要搬的样子，\n我就是要纠正你这种脾性！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n要不然这样，我一次对付你们俩好了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "95ED5634FF014F60660E660E642C4E0D52A853748FD8505A51FA8981642C768468375B50FF0C000A62115C31662F89817EA06B634F608FD979CD813E6027FF0100100001BE00000A89814E0D71368FD96837FF0C62114E006B215BF94ED84F604EEC4FE9597D4E86FF01001000020114018E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我来密阿雷市，\n就是为了挑战ZA登峰战！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n要是不能同时打败像你们这么弱的训练家，\n我就连参加挑战的资格都没有。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167655BC6963F96F75E02FF0C000A5C31662F4E3A4E8663116218005A0041767B5CF06218FF0100100001BE01000A8981662F4E0D80FD540C65F662538D2550CF4F604EEC8FD94E485F3176848BAD7EC35BB6FF0C000A62115C318FDE53C252A06311621876848D44683C90FD6CA167093002001000020114018E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你看，和他根本说不通。\n所以你就和我一起战斗吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60770BFF0C548C4ED66839672C8BF44E0D901A3002000A62404EE54F605C31548C62114E008D77621865975427FF01001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你可以和我一起战斗吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6053EF4EE5548C62114E008D77621865975417FF1F001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可以",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF4EE50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……要让我等到什么时候啊？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202689818BA962117B4952304EC04E4865F65019554AFF1F001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是顽皮熊猫带来了\n我和你相遇的机会。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F987D76AE718A732B5E2667654E86000A6211548C4F6076F890477684673A4F1A3002001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那时候真是抱歉，\n这次就请你多多指教咯！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A365F65019771F662F62B16B49FF0C000A8FD96B215C318BF74F60591A591A6307655954AFFF01001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就让本大爷的\n波士可多拉它们来打飞你们吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C318BA9672C592772377684000A6CE258EB53EF591A62C95B834EEC6765625398DE4F604EEC5427FF01001000020114018E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没想到密阿雷市的\n训练家的水准竟然如此之高啊……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA160F352305BC6963F96F75E027684000A8BAD7EC35BB676846C3451C67ADF713659826B644E4B9AD8554A20262026001000020114018E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我不参加ZA登峰战了！\n旅游完我就回家！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E0D53C252A0005A0041767B5CF062184E86FF01000A65C56E385B8C62115C3156DE5BB6FF01001000020114018E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "竟然要我搬运波士可多拉……\n他要是不乱说话，我会愿意带他到处逛逛的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7ADF713689816211642C8FD06CE258EB53EF591A62C920262026000A4ED68981662F4E0D4E718BF48BDDFF0C62114F1A613F610F5E264ED652305904901B901B76843002001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯洽。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EF6D3D30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "幸好有<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>你在，帮大忙了。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我明明拿过你的旅行包，\n但你还是帮了我，谢谢你。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E78597D670900100002010000004F605728FF0C5E2E59275FD94E86300200100001BE01000A6211660E660E62FF8FC74F60768465C5884C5305FF0C000A4F464F608FD8662F5E2E4E866211FF0C8C228C224F603002001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我那时看着顽皮熊猫\n搬着旅行包啊……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621190A365F6770B7740987D76AE718A732B000A642C774065C5884C5305554A20262026001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就想要为观光客搬运行李，\n还要带他们在密阿雷到处逛逛。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n于是我开始做这样的生意。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C3160F389814E3A89C251495BA2642C8FD0884C674EFF0C000A8FD889815E264ED64EEC57285BC6963F96F752305904901B901B300200100001BE00000A4E8E662F62115F0059CB505A8FD968377684751F610F3002001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果是宝可梦的话，\n还能从围墙上边或是没有人的地方通过。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C662F5B9D53EF68A676848BDDFF0C000A8FD880FD4ECE56F458994E0A8FB96216662F6CA167094EBA7684573065B9901A8FC73002001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "已经超过约好的时间了，你还好吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ-",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DF27ECF8D858FC77EA6597D768465F695F44E86FF0C4F608FD8597D5417FF1F001000020114002D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "安德烈？\n我没事。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B895FB770C8FF1F000A62116CA14E8B3002001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然发生了一些麻烦，\n但已经顺利解决了。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n嗯，我去你那边会合！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D713653D1751F4E864E004E9B9EBB70E6FF0C000A4F465DF27ECF987A522989E351B34E86300200100001BE00000A55EFFF0C621153BB4F6090A38FB94F1A5408FF01001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "听说你在ZA登峰战大显身手啊。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n能当上那么厉害的你在密阿雷的\n第一场宝可梦对战的对手，我很自豪。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "542C8BF44F605728005A0041767B5CF062185927663E8EAB624B554A300200100001BE01000A80FD5F534E0A90A34E4853895BB376844F6057285BC6963F96F77684000A7B2C4E00573A5B9D53EF68A65BF9621876845BF9624BFF0C62115F8881EA8C6A3002001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么，今后如果再在哪里遇见，\n就请你多多指教！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E48FF0C4ECA540E5982679C518D572854EA91CC904789C1FF0C000A5C318BF74F60591A591A63076559FF01001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    }
